{"Title":"An Act updating bicycle fines","BillNumber":"H3405","DocketNumber":"HD2122","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T11:07:33.907"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-11T11:07:33.9066667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3405/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Peisch of Wellesley, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3405) of Alice Hanlon Peisch for legislation to update bicycle fines.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 11B of chapter 85 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in line 1110, the words “twenty dollars” and inserting following :- the penalty a motor vehicle driver would be fined for the same traffic violation. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}